{"speciesId":416,"names":{"fr":"Apireine","es":"Vespiquen","en":"Vespiquen","ja":"ビークイン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its abdomen is a honeycomb for grubs. It raises its grubs on honey collected by COMBEE."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When endangered, grubs from its six-cell honeycomb strike back. There is only one in a colony."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It releases various pheromones to make the grubs in its body do its bidding while fighting foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It raises grubs in the holes in its body. It secretes pheromones to control COMBEE."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It raises grubs in the holes in its body. It secretes pheromones to control COMBEE."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce Pokémon utilise des phéromones pour donner des ordres de combat aux larves dans son abdomen."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It releases various pheromones to make the grubs in its body do its bidding while fighting foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce Pokémon utilise des phéromones pour donner des ordres de combat aux larves dans son abdomen."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It releases various pheromones to make the grubs in its body do its bidding while fighting foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It houses its colony in cells in its body and releases various pheromones to make those grubs do its bidding."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It houses its colony in cells in its body and releases various pheromones to make those grubs do its bidding."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son abdomen abrite ses petits. Ce Pokémon utilise des phéromones pour leur donner des ordres."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cría larvas en los panales de su cuerpo. Segrega diversas feromonas de su cuerpo con las cuales controla a sus crías."},{"language":"en","version":"x","t